  'postContent' => '
Hi everyone! My fiancé and I are just in the very beginning stages of planning our wedding for next winter in the Riviera Maya. I am wondering if anyone has any tips for planning a wedding in Mexico (we are working with a destination wedding travel agent already)? We are thinking of either getting married in November or January. Has anyone had any experiences planning a wedding in Mexico for either one of those months and has advice they\'d like to share? Besides price, what are the major differences between November and January? Any amazing resorts that are family friendly and reasonable cost for guests? Thanks a bunch!',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => 'df631b46122e5ddae7666b32a9f62c9f',
)
