Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":63,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904066,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1441246072,"LastPoster":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1904066,"PostDate":1441246072,"PostContent":"Hi everyone. \u00a0I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Pu...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441243817,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bcc5f38c5a3c81aeff83547712dc5d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone. &amp;nbsp;I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Puerto Rico. &amp;nbsp;We were to have married this Saturday, 9\/5\/15 here in Maryland but had to postpone while my FH deals with a medical issue. &amp;nbsp;This past month has been so emotionally difficult for us both and our families. &amp;nbsp;We went from a 30 day countdown to no countdown at all. &amp;nbsp;This was after planning for 1.5 years. :(&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;But it is OK. &amp;nbsp;What matters the most is my FH&#039;s health. I mean we can always choose another day for a wedding but without my man there&#039;s no wedding, right? &amp;nbsp;The good news is that he is responding well to treatment and has an excellent prognosis for a complete recovery. &amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since having to postpone our wedding my FH has talked nonstop about wanting to marry me ASAP after he gets through with his treatment. &amp;nbsp;We got a lot of people suggesting that we go to the JOP but we really wanted to have a ceremony. &amp;nbsp;My DH suggested going to an island with just immediately family and the closest of friends and to do it early in 2016 and then have a big reception. &amp;nbsp;So here I am planning a DW. &amp;nbsp;I am super excited and can&#039;t wait for our BIG DAY. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I look forward to planning with you all and reading all about your wedding day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904066,"PostDate":1441246072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone. \u00a0I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Puerto Rico. \u00a0We were to have married this Saturday, 9\/5\/15 here in Maryland but had to postpone while my FH deals with a medical issue. \u00a0This past month has been so emotionally difficult for us both and our families. \u00a0We went from a 30 day countdown to no countdown at all. \u00a0This was after planning for 1.5 years. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0 \u00a0But it is OK. \u00a0What matters the most is my FH's health. I mean we can always choose another day for a wedding but without my man there's no wedding, right? \u00a0The good news is that he is responding well to treatment and has an excellent prognosis for a complete recovery. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since having to postpone our wedding my FH has talked nonstop about wanting to marry me ASAP after he gets through with his treatment. \u00a0We got a lot of people suggesting that we go to the JOP but we really wanted to have a ceremony. \u00a0My DH suggested going to an island with just immediately family and the closest of friends and to do it early in 2016 and then have a big reception. \u00a0So here I am planning a DW. \u00a0I am super excited and can't wait for our BIG DAY. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I look forward to planning with you all and reading all about your wedding day. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441243817,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cf3bda4ab172e7907872bfcfe1bb274","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904067,"PostDate":1441247410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430534280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55f949c6ac8d9755073539a507073f3e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"1weddingirl\" post=\"1904067\" timestamp=\"1441247410\"]\nI&#039;m so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.[\/quote]\nThank you.  I see you are fairly new yourself.  How&#039;s everything going?","Attachments":[],"Id":1904069,"PostDate":1441247996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>1weddingirl, on Yesterday, 06:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0I see you are fairly new yourself. \u00a0How's everything going?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441243817,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e614e54b75cdb1f8485f58a4829c5f43","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ValentineMrs2Be\" post=\"1904069\" timestamp=\"1441247996\"]\nThank you.  I see you are fairly new yourself.  How&#039;s everything going?[\/quote]You&#039;re welcome. Yes, I&#039;m pretty new but enjoying the forum so far. Everything is going great, thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904075,"PostDate":1441249381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ValentineMrs2Be, on Yesterday, 06:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0I see you are fairly new yourself. \u00a0How's everything going?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You're welcome. Yes, I'm pretty new but enjoying the forum so far. Everything is going great, thanks.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430534280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a16a9d9104ecb4da535b6748b02ccbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome @[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] (and also&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"1weddingirl\"]!). I&#039;ve never been to PR - but it&#039;s on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904083,"PostDate":1441250882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> (and also\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282948\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282948-1weddingirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">1weddingirl<\/span><\/a>!). I've never been to PR - but it's on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f590765cf09c895fa3f8775a53ad55f","RawContent":"@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You&#039;ve both been through a lot and I&#039;m so glad that despite all the adversities, you&#039;ve both been optimistic. I&#039;m sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you&#039;ll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo","Attachments":[],"Id":1904085,"PostDate":1441251205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You've both been through a lot and I'm so glad that despite all the adversities, you've both been optimistic. I'm sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you'll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"990e12e10d56e29af58d0bcffe8ace1f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you&#039;re back to planning :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904100,"PostDate":1441285500,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you're back to planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79563","Title":"Dw Wedding After Postponing But I Am Ok.  Introducing Me.","LastPostDate":1441285500},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
