{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":299,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903633,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284593,"Name":"AngDima","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284593.jpg?_r=1441309394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440768176,"LastPoster":{"Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1903633,"PostDate":1440768176,"PostContent":"I'm looking to get a PDF or something with the Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall wedding package. Looking at a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.dimaggio9@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.36.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440767794,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284593.jpg?_r=1441309394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AngDima","Id":284593,"Name":"AngDima","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.54.36.158","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3d155e535b34ca6589ce9779c522edf","RawContent":"I&#039;m looking to get a PDF or something with the Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall wedding package. Looking at a few places trying to get each wedding package to narrow it down. If anyone has anything that would be helpful :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1903633,"PostDate":1440768176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm looking to get a PDF or something with the Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall wedding package. Looking at a few places trying to get each wedding package to narrow it down. If anyone has anything that would be helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.dimaggio9@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.36.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440767794,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284593.jpg?_r=1441309394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AngDima","Id":284593,"Name":"AngDima","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d5cdbbf38661e1ea8c3e1cde5930815","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was just at a wedding there in May. If you have any questions I will try to answer the best I can and what I cant answer I will ask the bride&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903638,"PostDate":1440771708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was just at a wedding there in May. If you have any questions I will try to answer the best I can and what I cant answer I will ask the bride<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 49 adult guests + bride and groom + 9 kids = 107 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401306470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c84b50372b4ea749b72da2f87b910b35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum AngDima and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of resources to help with your planning decisions - so hope you get the answers you&#039;re looking for :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to some of their wedding packages: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/News5Live\/photos\/a.484682104985999.1073741828.472013519586191\/798240553630151\/?type=1&amp;amp;theater&#039;&gt;Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall wedding packages&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research and all the best with your journey - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11885775_10153551240434487_148929687903931327_o.jpg\" alt=\"11885775_10153551240434487_1489296879039\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903660,"PostDate":1440783790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum AngDima and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you've come to the right place for lots of resources to help with your planning decisions - so hope you get the answers you're looking for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to some of their wedding packages: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/News5Live\/photos\/a.484682104985999.1073741828.472013519586191\/798240553630151\/?type=1&theater' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall wedding packages<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research and all the best with your journey - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11885775_10153551240434487_148929687903931327_o.jpg\" alt=\"11885775_10153551240434487_1489296879039\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.140.36.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99513243adec5d945524c53bd0341b03","RawContent":"@[member=\"TheBHolders\"] how was the wedding? Did you enjoy it as a guest?","Attachments":[],"Id":1903696,"PostDate":1440794467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a> how was the wedding? Did you enjoy it as a guest?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.dimaggio9@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.36.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440767794,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284593.jpg?_r=1441309394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AngDima","Id":284593,"Name":"AngDima","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d40d0b02340f0b266ace235a2273f08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AngDima\"] the wedding was lovely. As a guest I really enjoyed the resort, the only complaint we had as many of the other guests is that the couple did not allow for us to have down time. They literally had something planned the entire time. Other than that the staff was awesome, the jerk hut at the pool was my favorite, the Italian restaurant was very good. I didnt care for the buffet. I ate breakfast each morning at the open air restaurant, I cant remember the name. The beach is lovely and the water is nice and clear. Theres a trampoline in the water. The drinks are also made great. I found it weird that there werent any wristbands required. The Hyatt Ziva lounge at the airport was also great, especially for catching your breath after going through customs. It is about a 10-15 minute ride from the airport to the hotel. When we arrived, they brought us outside and handed us cocktails and our room keys. They literally scratched our names off a list and had our keys waiting for us. They do place a credit card hold on rooms. I believe it was $50 US.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The area is secluded, not much in walking distance, theres a shopping area further down the road, I didnt explore it. The Hyatt is across the street from the Great Witch House, which is one of the major attractions in the area. We didnt go, so I cant review it, we toured another plantation and did ATV and Zipline there as a group excursion. We also went out two nights to the clubs, about a 20-30 minute ride from the hotel. Be prepared to be charged at least $20 per person cash for a round trip taxi ride from the hotel. One girl in the group rode by herself to the club and was charged $40 for a roundtrip ride.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904038,"PostDate":1441230980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284593\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284593-angdima\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AngDima<\/span><\/a> the wedding was lovely. As a guest I really enjoyed the resort, the only complaint we had as many of the other guests is that the couple did not allow for us to have down time. They literally had something planned the entire time. Other than that the staff was awesome, the jerk hut at the pool was my favorite, the Italian restaurant was very good. I didnt care for the buffet. I ate breakfast each morning at the open air restaurant, I cant remember the name. The beach is lovely and the water is nice and clear. Theres a trampoline in the water. The drinks are also made great. I found it weird that there werent any wristbands required. The Hyatt Ziva lounge at the airport was also great, especially for catching your breath after going through customs. It is about a 10-15 minute ride from the airport to the hotel. When we arrived, they brought us outside and handed us cocktails and our room keys. They literally scratched our names off a list and had our keys waiting for us. They do place a credit card hold on rooms. I believe it was $50 US.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The area is secluded, not much in walking distance, theres a shopping area further down the road, I didnt explore it. The Hyatt is across the street from the Great Witch House, which is one of the major attractions in the area. We didnt go, so I cant review it, we toured another plantation and did ATV and Zipline there as a group excursion. We also went out two nights to the clubs, about a 20-30 minute ride from the hotel. Be prepared to be charged at least $20 per person cash for a round trip taxi ride from the hotel. One girl in the group rode by herself to the club and was charged $40 for a roundtrip ride.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 49 adult guests + bride and groom + 9 kids = 107 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401306470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"056588913a577c8f81abaeced750cd49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Had a wedding to attend there in July. The food and service are top-notch and their attention to detail is amazing. You&#039;ll love the airport lounge and if you really want to get an even better experience, book Club MoBay. You&#039;re free to message me if you have questions&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904068,"PostDate":1441251242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Had a wedding to attend there in July. The food and service are top-notch and their attention to detail is amazing. You'll love the airport lounge and if you really want to get an even better experience, book Club MoBay. You're free to message me if you have questions\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79543","Title":"Has Anyone Ever Got Married At Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall Jamaica","LastPostDate":1441251242},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
