 booked, my dad owes his own travel business so it makes it really easy. I look forward to see what everyone is talking about.<\/p>\n<p>cheers<\/p>\n<p>Candace. L<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candacelaczko2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.174.134.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440451955,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284555.jpg?_r=1441057241","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"claczko","Id":284555,"Name":"claczko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79554,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1855f02e5d9cd264ba9d06e5ed137e0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the site and congrats on your upcoming wedding!   These ladies are great! If you are looking for something particular, try the search option...I always say this site is better than google.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903848,"PostDate":1441107441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the site and congrats on your upcoming wedding!\u00a0\u00a0 These ladies are great! If you are looking for something particular, try the search option...I always say this site is better than google.<\/p>\n<p>\